---
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import MixerDashboard from '../components/demos/MixerDashboard.tsx';
---
<Base
  title="zvuk: Audio Engine for the Web"
  description="A Wwise-grade audio engine for the web. Named mixer buses with FX inserts, sidechain ducking, mix snapshots, audio sprites, and a codec ladder that survives Safari. ESM-only, type-safe, 17 kB min+gzip."
>
  <Hero />

  <section class="container py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-4">A real engine, not a wrapper.</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-4">
        zvuk gives you the vocabulary game-audio engineers expect: <strong class="text-foreground">Engine</strong>,
        <strong class="text-foreground">Mixer</strong>, <strong class="text-foreground">Bus</strong>,
        <strong class="text-foreground">Send</strong>, <strong class="text-foreground">Sound</strong>,
        <strong class="text-foreground">Voice</strong>, <strong class="text-foreground">Snapshot</strong>,
        <strong class="text-foreground">Parameter</strong>. Routing is declarative.
        Lifecycle is explicit. The <code class="text-primary font-mono">AudioContext</code>
        is constructed lazily, so calling <code class="text-primary font-mono">createEngine()</code>
        before any user gesture is safe.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        Built for any application where audio matters. Games, interactive learning,
        ambient web experiences, kiosks, music apps. If you've ever fought autoplay
        on iOS or watched a clip cut itself off mid-playback, zvuk is the layer that
        handles those problems for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2">Try it.</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">
        A live mixer running the actual engine. Real samples, real Web Audio. iOS-safe.
      </p>
      <MixerDashboard client:visible />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/docs/quickstart/" class="group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-primary/[0.04]">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-primary mb-2">Start here</div>
        <div class="font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-primary">Quickstart</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">pnpm add @schmooky/zvuk. Two function calls. Sound out of the speakers.</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/concepts/engine/" class="group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-primary/[0.04]">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-primary mb-2">Concepts</div>
        <div class="font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-primary">The Engine</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">State machine, lifecycle, unlock. The Big One.</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/recipes/" class="group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-primary/[0.04]">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-primary mb-2">Recipes</div>
        <div class="font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-primary">Click → hear → copy</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Six live, copy-pasteable patterns. Slot reel, ducking, snapshots, more.</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
